      ["zealous","🔥","กระตือรือร้นอย่างแรงกล้า","very enthusiastic and passionate","He is a zealous supporter of the local team."],
      ["cogent","🧠","หนักแน่นมีเหตุผล","clear, logical and convincing","She made a cogent case for reform."],
      ["equivocal","🤔","กำกวม (โดยเจตนา)","unclear and open to more than one meaning","His equivocal answer left us confused."],
      ["insidious","🐍","ร้ายกาจแบบค่อยเป็นค่อยไป","spreading harm slowly and secretly","Stress can have an insidious effect on health."],
      ["verbose","🗯️","พูดเยิ่นเย้อ","using more words than needed","The verbose report could be half as long."]
